cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the original paper it replicates, and this repository."
title: "Null-imputation benchmark: replication and deployment extension of 2OS (2023), Group 10"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible reconstruction of the null-imputation experiment in
  "A Comparison of Modeling Preprocessing Techniques" (2nd Order Solutions,
  arXiv:2302.12042), covering the GAM-global synthetic data set with a Random
  Forest, plus a deployment-oriented extension covering preprocessing cost,
  missing-data budgets, missingness mechanisms and feature irreplaceability.
version: "1.0.0"
